  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 88 ÷ 4 − 15 × 3 = 1 + 4\n\nOption 1) = and +\n\nAfter two signs interchanged:\n\n⇒ __**88 ÷ 4**__ − 15 × 3 + 1 = 4\n\n⇒ 22 − __**15 × 3**__ + 1 = 4\n\n⇒ __**22**__ − 45 **__+ 1__** = 4\n\n⇒ __**23 − 45**__ = 4\n\n⇒ -22 = 4\n\nOption 2) = and -\n\nAfter two signs interchanged:\n\n⇒ __**88 ÷ 4**__ = __**15 × 3**__ - 1 + 4\n\n⇒ 22 = __**45**__ - 1 __**+ 4**__\n\n⇒ 22 = __**49 - 1**__\n\n⇒ 22 = 48 \n\nOption 3) = and ÷ \n\nAfter two signs interchanged:\n\n⇒ 88 = 4 − 15 × __**3 ÷ 1**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 88 = 4 − __**15 × 3**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 88 = __**4 **__− 45__** + 4**__\n\n⇒ 88 = __**8 − 45**__\n\n⇒ 88 = -37\n\n**Option 4) = and ×**\n\nAfter two signs interchanged:\n\n⇒ __**88 ÷ 4**__ − 15 = __**3 × 1**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**22 − 15**__ = __**3 + 4**__\n\n⇒ 7 = 7\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"= and ×\".",
